# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  ENQUIRY FORM — EMAIL DELIVERY
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
#  Without these three variables the form still works, but
#  enquiries are only written to the server console and are
#  effectively lost. You will not be emailed.
#
#  1. Create a free account at https://resend.com
#  2. Verify your sending domain (Studio > Domains > Add)
#  3. Create an API key (API Keys > Create API Key)
#  4. Fill in the three values below
#
#  Copy this file to `.env.local` and never commit that file.
#  `.env.local` is already in .gitignore.

# Your Resend API key — starts with "re_"
RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_key_here

# Where enquiries are delivered. Must be a verified sender or a
# confirmed address on your Resend account.
ENQUIRY_TO_EMAIL=you@yourdomain.com

# Who the email appears to come from. Must be on a verified domain.
# For a first test before your domain is verified, Resend allows:
#   ENQUIRY_FROM_EMAIL=Enquiries <onboarding@resend.dev>
ENQUIRY_FROM_EMAIL=Enquiries <hello@yourdomain.com>


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  OPTIONAL — IMAGE OPTIMISATION
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
#  Currently OFF (images.unoptimized = true in next.config.ts)
#  because the site ships placeholder <img> tags.
#
#  When you replace the placeholders with real photographs, set
#  unoptimized to false in next.config.ts to get automatic
#  resizing, WebP/AVIF conversion, and CDN delivery.
